{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fba79221267b8a05fb8e4e277a9755460af5aea1cfc068dd3c107a73623bba14", "ja": "（茜のPV撮影が終わった。茜も、エキストラの\n子ども達も楽しそうだったし、いいPVになりそうだ）", "zh": "（茜的PV拍摄结束了。茜和那些临时出演的孩子们看起来都很开心，应该能拍出很棒的PV）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ee7698b4f7197d00c31f3087a6b5d2748cc01d9fe8880a9dddd0f735a08aa608", "ja": "茜、お疲れさま。今日は\nみんなにサインまでしてくれて、ありがとうな。", "zh": "茜，辛苦了。今天还给大家签名，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "117797864d25f758b5c7339d4e089e0d87dd31dda2d5af7b9ebc6c009b85ccbf", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんも、お疲れさま！\n茜ちゃんのPV撮影だし、それくらいお安いご用だよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}也辛苦啦！\n毕竟是小茜的PV拍摄，那种小事包在茜身上啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "7d94a88d3f122bdb1eff494430ad0a8a21c3f1edba0e46085db3a598bcab917a", "ja": "みんなのアイドル、完璧な美少女こと茜ちゃんは\n画面の中だけでなく、実物も女神のようだった……！", "zh": "大家的偶像、完美美少女小茜，不仅在屏幕中，真人也宛如女神一般……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "c7ddb6d93a50987a8d5a35001bdc27c445dc08783172ae903e87acebe96885e2", "ja": "そして茜ちゃんの神対応は子供たちによって\n語り継がれ、やがて……伝説のアイドルとなるのだー！", "zh": "而小茜的神级应对被孩子们代代传颂，最终……成为传说中的偶像啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1005_p", "source_sha256": "14a4ecfc6d72773d53f31133a225c96a78ee0258d32855b1da3f59a2b2986984", "ja": "あ、そういう事だったのか……。\nまぁでもみんな喜んでたし、結果オーライかな。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事啊……。\n不过大家都很开心，结果还算不错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "877c2b3adb3d0a1be1eb65aacc04cabb3815912edcbf6bbcd5a842eadd5bd9c4", "ja": "そうそう！　茜ちゃんくらい、かわいさと才能を\n併せ持ってたら、目標は高くないとね♪", "zh": "对对！要是能兼具小茜般的可爱与才华，目标当然得定得高一点嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "95cc19db544505397f36e6c3a2d6df4fba216e7220c1c8304e65a0431a0eebf9", "ja": "伝説のアイドルとして自伝を発表すれば、ミリオン\nセラー間違いなし！　夢の印税生活に突入だー！", "zh": "只要以传说偶像的身份发表自传，成为百万畅销书绝对没问题！就此步入梦寐以求的版税人生——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4d65d524becb7943120801a6d05fbf1dd6ffec8b8f983ff1f7a6515186f7c5c3", "ja": "それが狙いだったのか……。\nでも、そう簡単に上手くいくとは思えないけど。", "zh": "原来那才是你的目标啊……\n不过，我觉得事情没那么容易成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "616caee6ffa2e59159fcae4f7c678aaab4b131bcf2aaf7a8b46d830a13f6e65e", "ja": "そんなコトないよ！　それに、茜ちゃんから\nみんなへの愛はウソじゃないよ！　ホンモノだから！", "zh": "才不是那样呢！而且，小茜对大家的爱也不是假的！是真心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "5b0ba48910ea29569ddc3fdaba3601541d162c09980c84ee9c8d26f00ca0adc2", "ja": "茜ちゃんも、アイドルに憧れてた時代があったし。\nだからこそ、子どもたちの憧れの存在でいたいんです！", "zh": "小茜也曾有过憧憬偶像的时期嘛。正因为如此，我才想成为孩子们憧憬的对象！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "de614c3eb4a420a3449959e332c8598a851d649504bfd4d57f325827fd929f1c", "ja": "今の茜ちゃんは、子供たちに憧れられる\nスーパーアイドル！　みんなの夢は、守らないとね♪", "zh": "现在的小茜，可是让孩子们憧憬的超级偶像！大家的梦想，可要好好守护才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3272cc51151b4e02b9e71ffd46b1ffb775cfd6f5ffc7d0b1bb7ea7b4eec99b1c", "ja": "スーパーアイドルを自称するのは、まだ早いけどな！\nでも、茜の気持ちはわかったよ。", "zh": "现在自称超级偶像，还为时过早吧！  \n不过，我明白茜的心情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "7754fa8dfc5046baf6f519b4e4fd605c18d3a3d01ce0f4006d38197cf7049323", "ja": "え、なになに？　茜ちゃんの新たな一面を見て、\nあまりのかわいさに、ときめいちゃったとか？", "zh": "诶，什么什么？看到小茜不为人知的一面，被可爱得心动了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "c5115dfe15c53f2b270786c8ac2272788d75e430c1639be21ec67df89a59ac27", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、照れなくていいよ！\n特別に、茜ちゃんにプリンを奢る権利をあげようか？", "zh": "{$P$}，不用害羞啦！\n特别给你一个请小茜吃布丁的权利，要不要？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8f2f956c37e0f59229fb7181f14ff4904baf50cfe884ac7e6370710e84ec213a", "ja": "はは、そうだな。今日の茜はすごく頑張ってたし、\nプリンくらいなら喜んでご馳走するよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。今天的茜确实很努力，\n请你吃个布丁，我还是很乐意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "2976feaf922f17dbce235e25d89badddd534a36dcc81a5b28a291dc0581a1aa1", "ja": "ニャッ！？　お、思いがけない素直なデレ対応……\nさしもの茜ちゃんもびっくりだよ……。", "zh": "喵！？这、这出乎意料的坦率宠溺回应……就连小茜也吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "ead480b8d5e7997a65e082ca02e70eb18761be8edd75d6c91e52210df2ebfa1c", "ja": "でも、遠慮なくいただくことにするね！\nありがと、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "不过，我就不客气地收下啦！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "585df34a3a16e82d46880c929b4ea81dd2d8e70cbcb0b8aacb67a60c1b4ca630", "ja": "ご褒美ももらったし……次のお仕事でも、\n伝説のアイドル茜ちゃんに、乞うご期待だよ♪", "zh": "既然也拿到奖励了……下次工作中，也敬请期待传奇偶像小茜哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0174_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cb8278909c2ad5dbb454b1a581aa5499a3a3ac9c5e8e454b4a61937db17ef58a", "ja": "（茜は茜なりのアイドル像、そして将来を思い描いて\nいるようだ……しっかり支えていかないとな！）", "zh": "（茜似乎正在描绘着属于自己的偶像形象，以及自己的未来……我也得好好支持她才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
